[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13140.07, "timestamp": "03:39:00", "text": "嗯，回到Twitch的时候，我当时是这样的："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13142.87, "timestamp": "03:39:02", "text": "呃，就像我当时在想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13145.269, "timestamp": "03:39:05", "text": "多目标，就像我以前那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13147.91, "timestamp": "03:39:07", "text": "将 Twitch 直播等内容单独列出"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13149.99, "timestamp": "03:39:09", "text": "将会是这类内容，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13152.15, "timestamp": "03:39:12", "text": "届时YouTube将恢复正常。曾是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13154.469, "timestamp": "03:39:14", "text": "就像如此专注于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13157.19, "timestamp": "03:39:17", "text": "嗯，正在申请YouTube合作伙伴资格"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13159.269, "timestamp": "03:39:19", "text": "这样我就可以获得那些功能了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13162.469, "timestamp": "03:39:22", "text": "被 YouTube 合作伙伴锁定"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13164.79, "timestamp": "03:39:24", "text": "比如聊天规则之类的，都对。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13167.429, "timestamp": "03:39:27", "text": "当你在Twitch聊天室输入文字时，你会看到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13170.71, "timestamp": "03:39:30", "text": "规则会自动弹出该窗口"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13174.309, "timestamp": "03:39:34", "text": "YouTube 会员专享内容已锁定"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13177.19, "timestamp": "03:39:37", "text": "那玩意儿，我就惊叹了，你不能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13180.229, "timestamp": "03:39:40", "text": "即使是突袭，除非你拥有类似的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13182.55, "timestamp": "03:39:42", "text": "会员制度或者类似千人制之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13186.07, "timestamp": "03:39:46", "text": "粉丝、订阅者有很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13188.15, "timestamp": "03:39:48", "text": "好的功能就像被锁在那里一样，所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13191.11, "timestamp": "03:39:51", "text": "我当时就想，哇，原来我的目标就是这个啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13195.19, "timestamp": "03:39:55", "text": "在某种程度上，嗯，我认为我专注于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13197.99, "timestamp": "03:39:57", "text": "YouTube发展得越来越好，我感到很伤心"}]